[StartVolumeWater],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsLevelProductIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsTemperatureAmbientIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsTemperatureDensityIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsTemperatureProductIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsDensityProductObservedIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsDensityProductStandardIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsVolumeIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UnitsMassIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[DecimalPlacesVolume],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[DecimalPlacesLevel],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[DecimalPlacesDensity],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[DecimalPlacesTemperature],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData01],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData02],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData03],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData04],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData05],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData06],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData07],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData08],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData09],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UserData10],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferDeviation],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferPercentDeviation],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[DecimalPlacesPercent],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferMode],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferStatus],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferTarget],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferTargetUnitsIndex],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferLevelTarget],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferVolumeTarget],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferTimeRemaining],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferDirection],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[CommentDateTime],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[CommentUserID],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[Status],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[VolumeWater],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[LevelProduct],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[StartDensityProductStandardInAir],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferredVolumeWater],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[TransferredVolume],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[MidnightRecord],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[PointGuid],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[RootParentGuid],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[RecordSeq],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[CreatedDate],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[CreatedBy],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UpdatedDate],[dbo].[tblMovementHistory].[UpdatedBy],CT.InsertedRowVersion AS '_RowVersion'
